<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Orbital Engine cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Orbital Engine cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Monday it had cut its rating on Orbital Engine Corp Ltd of Australia to near-term neutral from near-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill kept its long-term rating of accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Orbital's American Depositary Receipts closed Friday at 6-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
